  "title": "Unsupervised Keypoint-Based Retinal Image Registration: A New Approach for Medical Applications",
  "summary": "This work presents an unsupervised registration pipeline for retinal image alignment, eliminating the need for labeled data and leveraging descriptors to achieve accurate and reliable results. The method operates by conditioning the detector on the descriptor rather than the opposite, offering a flexible and scalable solution for color fundus image registration in medical contexts.",
